<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Apps · Möbius OS</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Curated mini-apps for Möbius OS.">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="../mobius-brand.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://rsms.me/">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://rsms.me/inter/inter.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site">
    <div class="inner">
      <a class="brand" href="../">
        <img src="../mobius-brand.png" alt="" class="brand-mark" width="28" height="28">
        <span>Möbius OS</span>
      </a>
      <nav>
        <a href="./" class="is-active">Apps</a>
        <a href="../spec/">Spec</a>
        <a href="../docs/contributing.html">Build</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <h1>Curated apps</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      A small, hand-picked catalog. Anyone can install any of these via the App
      Store mini-app inside Möbius, or by pasting the manifest URL.
    </p>

    <div class="grid">
      {%- for app in apps %}
      <a class="card" href="{{ app.page_slug }}.html">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="icon">
            {%- if app.icon_url %}
            <img src="{{ app.icon_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
            {%- else %}
            <span>{{ app.name[0] }}</span>
            {%- endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="card-title">
            <h3>{{ app.name }}</h3>
            <span class="card-version">v{{ app.version }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>{{ app.description }}</p>
        {%- if app.badges %}
        <div class="badges">
          {%- for b in app.badges %}
          <span class="badge">{{ b }}</span>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
      {%- for _ in range(coming_soon_count) %}
      <div class="card placeholder">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="icon"><span>·</span></div>
          <div class="card-title">
            <h3>Coming soon</h3>
            <span class="card-version">—</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Reserved slot. Next curated app drops here.</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <h2>Build your own</h2>
    <p>
      Any public repo with a valid <code>mobius.json</code> is installable
      via paste-a-URL in the App Store mini-app. Apps don't need to be on
      this curated list to be shared — host the manifest anywhere
      (GitHub, Codeberg, GitLab, a personal site) and the URL is the
      install link. See <a href="../docs/contributing.html">Build a Möbius app</a>
      for the manifest schema and the storage / cron contracts.
    </p>
  </main>

  <footer class="site">
    <div class="inner">
      <span>Möbius OS · MIT</span>
      <span><a href="https://github.com/mobius-os">github.com/mobius-os</a></span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
